Stack layout of the `S̃` axis (all outside `GL.myW = 0 … 30`):

| stack | content                    | role                                  |
|-------|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|
| 31    | `sOff s w`                 | `Ka` of `sapP`                        |
| 32    | `s + (2w+1)`               | `KN`                                  |
